active per token</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Architecture</strong></td><td>Hybrid MoE =E2=80=94 Ga=
ted DeltaNet + Gated Attention (48 layers)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Experts</strong></td><td>512 total, 10 active + 1 sha=
red per token</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Context Window</strong></td><td>256K tokens native, ~=
