<p>
  <strong>The sweet spot for most people:</strong> Q5_K_M quantization on a=
 64GB system. Community testers confirm 95% token accuracy at this level, a=
nd it fits comfortably in memory even at 65K context. Going below Q4 notice=
ably degrades output quality =E2=80=94 don't bother with Q3 or lower.
</p>

